1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,536
Hey techies! Sneha here

2
00:00:02,536 --> 00:00:04,318
from Zillenial Talk.

3
00:00:04,318 --> 00:00:06,100
Season 1, episode 2.

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,685
Before we talk AI,

5
00:00:07,685 --> 00:00:09,579
we need one word: software.

6
00:00:09,879 --> 00:00:10,901
Think of software as

7
00:00:10,901 --> 00:00:11,631
a recipe card.

8
00:00:12,281 --> 00:00:13,353
A human writes every

9
00:00:13,353 --> 00:00:14,528
step, and the computer

10
00:00:14,528 --> 00:00:15,651
follows them exactly.

11
00:00:15,951 --> 00:00:17,366
So, usually, the same

12
00:00:17,366 --> 00:00:19,039
ingredients give the same

13
00:00:19,039 --> 00:00:20,197
dish, every time.

14
00:00:20,847 --> 00:00:21,816
AI is different.

15
00:00:21,816 --> 00:00:22,671
It's more like

16
00:00:22,671 --> 00:00:23,811
a chef who's cooked

17
00:00:23,811 --> 00:00:24,951
thousands of meals.

18
00:00:25,251 --> 00:00:26,388
Nobody handed that chef

19
00:00:26,388 --> 00:00:27,477
a card for every dish.

20
00:00:27,777 --> 00:00:28,733
They learned patterns

21
00:00:28,733 --> 00:00:29,385
from practice.

22
00:00:30,035 --> 00:00:31,179
Quick reality check:

23
00:00:31,179 --> 00:00:32,105
a chef can taste

24
00:00:32,105 --> 00:00:32,650
the soup.

25
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,004
An AI model only

26
00:00:34,004 --> 00:00:35,740
finds patterns in examples.

27
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:36,793
It doesn't taste

28
00:00:36,793 --> 00:00:37,723
or understand.

29
00:00:38,373 --> 00:00:39,834
So software is instructions

30
00:00:39,834 --> 00:00:40,877
a computer follows.

31
00:00:41,177 --> 00:00:42,447
Next up: what AI

32
00:00:42,447 --> 00:00:43,419
actually is.

33
00:00:43,719 --> 00:00:45,063
One tech concept.

34
00:00:45,063 --> 00:00:46,408
One simple story.

35
00:00:46,408 --> 00:00:47,902
I'm Sneha, and this

36
00:00:47,902 --> 00:00:49,321
is Zillenial Talk.

